{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370110/extras/306426c0b52c279d857a4969f34f0b80.avif?t=1723547362\" width=500 height=100 /></span><br><br>Sarab 2: Thalj Mountains is the second sequence to Sarab series. It is a traditional JRPG-styled game which focuses on story-telling, exploration and turn-based battling. Each main character has its own mysterious story. Furthermore, the game has a unique atmosphere which absolutely makes it a different experience in comparison to other JRPG games.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370110/extras/1af33dd93b9366b8a012a69313d018d7.avif?t=1723547362\" width=500 height=100 /></span><br><br>After Sarab and his friends defeated one of the Five Devils and obtained the Fire Crystal, he found himself with a new adventure and a very mysterious task about missing two hearts. During their journey, Sanad and Zara suddenly disappeared due to magical powers which teleported them to a place called Thalj Mountains. In the other hand, the Five Devils\u2019 boss, Goblet of Death, sensed the movement of an old enemy and felt the need to trace him immediately.<br><br>What is the story of the two hearts? What will Sarab do without Sanad and Zara? And who is his next enemy? Will they reunite again?<br>You will experience all of it in this in a profoundly emotional and unforgettable story in the second sequence of Sarab series.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1370110/extras/0810a685c07043c9e3e89e56cc177253.avif?t=1723547362\" width=500 height=100 /></span><br><br>-\tA mid-length RPG that focuses on storytelling<br>-\tNo side quests<br>-\tNo random encounters!<br>-\tCharacter Art<br>-\tDetailed graphics<br>-\tArea Map System","background":"https://store.akamai